  "caption": "Before comparing Cyprus properties, compare the full acquisition cost.\n\nDLS says no transfer fee is collected when VAT is charged on the same transaction for the same property, subject to its stated conditions. Where transfer fees are charged, a 50% discount applies, with exceptions.\n\nHave the exact property and transaction checked before budgeting.\n\nSource: Cyprus DLS: sale and exchange.\nhttps://portal.dls.moi.gov.cy/en/application_forms/polisi-antallagi/\n\n#Cyprus #CyprusProperty #RealEstate #Investment #TheSmartySolution",
